            "value" : "%@ de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ holds %@, which is also your ask key, so the microphone opens for as long as you hold the chord. Nothing is recorded or sent — the hold is thrown away when the bar opens — but pick a combination without %@ if you would rather it never opened at all." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ holds %2$@, which is also your ask key, so the microphone opens for as long as you hold the chord. Nothing is recorded or sent — the hold is thrown away when the bar opens — but pick a combination without %3$@ if you would rather it never opened at all."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ incluye %@, que también es tu tecla para preguntar, así que el micrófono se abre mientras mantengas la combinación. No se graba ni se envía nada (lo captado se descarta al abrirse la barra), pero elige una combinación sin %@ si prefieres que nunca se abra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ holds %@, which is also your dictation key, so pressing it can start dictation too. Pick a combination without %@ if you would rather it never did." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ incluye %2$@, que también es tu tecla de dictado, así que pulsarla puede iniciar el dictado. Elige una combinación sin %3$@ si prefieres que no pase nunca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ holds %@, which is also your dictation key, so the microphone opens for as long as you hold the chord. Nothing is recorded or sent — the hold is thrown away when the bar opens — but pick a combination without %@ if you would rather it never opened at all." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ holds %2$@, which is also your dictation key, so the microphone opens for as long as you hold the chord. Nothing is recorded or sent — the hold is thrown away when the bar opens — but pick a combination without %3$@ if you would rather it never opened at all."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ incluye %@, que también es tu tecla de dictado, así que el micrófono se abre mientras mantengas la combinación. No se graba ni se envía nada (lo captado se descarta al abrirse la barra), pero elige una combinación sin %@ si prefieres que nunca se abra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
