    "Following %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Siguiendo %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follows the display set as main" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sigue a la pantalla configurada como principal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a meeting in the room, press Take notes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para una reunión presencial, pulsa Tomar notas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For people who use Claude Code or Codex" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para quien usa Claude Code o Codex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For people who use Claude Code or Codex: the Agents tab and its settings page, connecting them, Claude usage, and handing a question to Claude Code. A request waiting for your answer always shows, whatever this says." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para quien usa Claude Code o Codex: la pestaña Agentes y su página de ajustes, conectarlos, el uso de Claude y pasarle una pregunta a Claude Code. Una solicitud que espera tu respuesta siempre se muestra, diga lo que diga esto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For that, Airlock downloads a voice model once, about 100 MB. Nothing about you is sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para eso, Airlock descarga una vez un modelo de voz de unos 100 MB. No se envía nada sobre ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For the ones that don't mark copies private" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para los que no marcan las copias como privadas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For when you switch between two languages as you speak. Airlock listens for both and types whichever it understood better. Dictation takes a moment longer, and your Mac downloads the language the first time you pick it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para cuando cambias entre dos idiomas al hablar. Airlock escucha ambos y escribe el que haya entendido mejor. El dictado tarda un poco más, y tu Mac descarga el idioma la primera vez que lo eliges."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free answers one agent at a time, so %@'s question went to its terminal. On Plus, every agent can ask you here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free responde a un agente cada vez, así que la pregunta de %@ ha ido a su terminal. Con Plus, todos los agentes pueden preguntarte aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free answers one agent at a time, so this one is asking in its terminal. Plus answers every agent here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free responde a un agente cada vez, así que este está preguntando en su terminal. Plus responde aquí a todos los agentes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free covers dictation, the notch's widgets, and approving your coding agents one at a time, with no card. Plus adds notes for the whole call, written online on any Mac, even one without Apple Intelligence. Pro has them written by the best model we've tested. Already paying? Change plan on your subscription page, so you never pay twice. Cancel whenever you like: it keeps working until the end of the period you paid for, then moves to Free, and nothing is deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free incluye dictado, los widgets del notch y aprobar a tus agentes de programación de uno en uno, sin tarjeta. Plus añade notas de toda la llamada, escritas online en cualquier Mac, incluso sin Apple Intelligence. Pro las hace escribir con el mejor modelo que hemos probado. ¿Ya pagas? Cambia de plan en tu página de suscripción, para no pagar nunca dos veces. Cancela cuando quieras: sigue funcionando hasta el final del periodo pagado, luego pasa a Free y no se borra nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free covers the guide that helps with everyday tasks on screen, dictation, the notch's widgets, and approving your coding agents one at a time, with no card. Plus adds notes for the whole call, written online on any Mac, even one without Apple Intelligence. Pro has them written by the best model we've tested. Already paying? Change plan on your subscription page, so you never pay twice. Cancel whenever you like: it keeps working until the end of the period you paid for, then moves to Free, and nothing is deleted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free incluye la guía que te ayuda con tareas cotidianas en pantalla, dictado, los widgets del notch y aprobar a tus agentes de programación de uno en uno, sin tarjeta. Plus añade notas de toda la llamada, escritas online en cualquier Mac, incluso sin Apple Intelligence. Pro las hace escribir con el mejor modelo que hemos probado. ¿Ya pagas? Cambia de plan en tu página de suscripción, para no pagar nunca dos veces. Cancela cuando quieras: sigue funcionando hasta el final del periodo pagado, luego pasa a Free y no se borra nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free keeps your last %lld copies, so the oldest ones now make room for new ones. Plus keeps up to %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free keeps your last %1$lld copies, so the oldest ones now make room for new ones. Plus keeps up to %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free guarda tus últimas %lld copias, así que las más antiguas dejan sitio a las nuevas. Plus guarda hasta %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free keeps your last %lld, not counting pinned items. Plus keeps up to %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free keeps your last %1$lld, not counting pinned items. Plus keeps up to %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free guarda las últimas %lld, sin contar las fijadas. Plus guarda hasta %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free notes are written on your Mac and never leave it. Plus and Pro write them online, and no audio is kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con Free, las notas se escriben en tu Mac y nunca salen de él. Plus y Pro las escriben online, y no se guarda el audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free's notes cover the first %lld minutes. After that Airlock goes on listening and holds the rest %lld days, for Plus." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free's notes cover the first %1$lld minutes. After that Airlock goes on listening and holds the rest %2$lld days, for Plus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las notas de Free cubren los primeros %lld minutos. Después, Airlock sigue escuchando y guarda el resto %lld días, para Plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free's notes covered the first %lld minutes. The other %lld were kept on this Mac, and are open now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free's notes covered the first %1$lld minutes. The other %2$lld were kept on this Mac, and are open now."
