    "Trackpad feedback is a light tap when you approve or deny a request, switch tabs, drop a file on the shelf, or scroll to the end of a list. Only things you do, never things that happen on their own. Mac trackpads only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
